        <p>Lendora is mortgage-pipeline intelligence for loan officers: dense data, calm surfaces. Every screen is a composition of frosted-glass cards floating on a warm grey canvas. This board is the single source of truth for design and engineering — the tokens documented here are the tokens shipped in <code>index.css</code>. When this file and the code disagree, this file wins until a PR says otherwise.</p>
