  <div class="panel">
    <div class="shead">
      <div class="num">02</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Typography</h2>
        <p>One family — <b>Outfit</b> (variable, 200–700) — carries the entire product. Display numerals run extra-light with tight tracking; interface text sits at 400; descriptions drop to 300. Letter-spacing is negative from 15px upward and never positive except uppercase micro-labels.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tags"><span class="tag">family · Outfit</span><span class="tag">fallback · system-ui</span><span class="tag">numerals · tabular in tables</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="subhead"><h3>Type scale</h3><span class="hint">Nine roles · size / line-height / weight / tracking</span></div>
    <div class="type-rows">
      <div class="type-row"><div class="tn"><b>Display</b><span>type/display</span></div><div class="t-display">$12.4M <span style="color:var(--faint)">82</span></div><div class="spec">56 / 52 · w200 · ls −4.5%<br><i>KPI numerals, gauges — never prose</i></div></div>
