      <div class="type-row"><div class="tn"><b>Heading 3</b><span>type/h3</span></div><div class="t-h3">Active Loan Pipeline</div><div class="spec">19 / 24 · w500 · ls −2%<br><i>Card &amp; modal titles</i></div></div>
      <div class="type-row"><div class="tn"><b>Body large</b><span>type/body-l</span></div><div class="t-bodyl">Rate Calculator — amortisation &amp; escrow modelling for locked locks.</div><div class="spec">15.5 / 22 · w400 · ls −1%<br><i>Drawer headings, empty-state leads</i></div></div>
