    <div class="behav">
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#F4C74B"></span> Hierarchy</h5><p>One dark primary per surface. Secondary = soft white pill, tertiary = ghost. Amber buttons only for money-positive actions (fund, advance, pin).</p></div>
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#F4C74B"></span> Hover &amp; press</h5><p>Hover lifts −1px and shifts background; press scales to 96.5% for 90ms. Disabled controls keep layout, drop shadow, ignore pointer, and never hover.</p></div>
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#F4C74B"></span> Focus</h5><p>Keyboard-only ring: 2px <code>--am-600</code>, offset 2px, on light; white ring on dark surfaces. Mouse clicks must not show rings (<code>:focus-visible</code>).</p></div>
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#8CA0DC"></span> Overlays</h5><p>Modals: <span class="kbd">Esc</span> + scrim click close, focus trapped, width 520/560. Drawers slide from their edge over scrim ink-30 + blur. One overlay layer at a time.</p></div>
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#8CA0DC"></span> Menus &amp; selects</h5><p>Close on outside click or <span class="kbd">Esc</span>; selected option carries a check; menu inherits trigger width, min 176px; opens with <code>pop</code> (spring, origin top).</p></div>
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#8CA0DC"></span> Feedback</h5><p>Toasts: bottom-center, max 3 stacked, auto-dismiss 2.6s, past-tense copy. Destructive actions need a modal confirm — never a toast undo.</p></div>
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#7BB694"></span> Tables</h5><p>Row hover reveals a floating toolbar (5 tools max) centered over the row; selection uses round checkboxes; horizontal scroll below 720px keeps the ID column visible.</p></div>
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#7BB694"></span> Navigation</h5><p>The active pill indicator is measured, not animated by class: offsetLeft/offsetWidth + ResizeObserver, 550ms expo. Mobile collapses to a scrollable strip, no scrollbar.</p></div>
      <div class="note"><h5><span class="statedot" style="background:#7BB694"></span> Data viz</h5><p>Amber = volume, periwinkle = in-flight, mint = complete, coral = rejected. Gridlines ink 10–12%; axis type is micro 10.5 faint. Animate with scaleX/scaleY from origin, 900ms expo. Charts draw once on mount (1.1–1.5s); forecast tails are hatched ink 13% at −35°, never solid; node dots r4 with white ring mark the history/forecast seam.</p></div>
    </div>

