        <ul>
          <li>Colour as the only signal — pair every tone with a dot, icon or label.</li>
          <li>Hover-only affordances without a keyboard or touch equivalent.</li>
          <li>Contrast below 4.5:1 for text, 3:1 for UI boundaries.</li>
          <li>Focus loss when a modal or toast closes.</li>
        </ul>
